        "screening_benefit": "At clinically relevant screening recall targets (>= 70% and >= 80%), the 90/10 Hybrid achieves substantially lower false-alert burdens than Standard XGBoost. At >= 70% recall, the Hybrid eliminates 42 false alerts (a 15.1% reduction). At >= 80% recall, the Hybrid eliminates 73 false alerts (a 17.5% reduction) while detecting 2 additional faltering children (23/24 vs 21/24, 95.8% coverage).",
